</tbody></table></div><span class="anchor" id="line-19"></span><span class="anchor" id="line-20"></span><p class="line867">
<h1 id="Objetivo">Objetivo</h1>
<span class="anchor" id="line-21"></span><p class="line874">O objetivo da release 2.0 é acrescentar no Faleweb o desenvolvimento: <span class="anchor" id="line-22"></span><ul><li>Recompilar como o novo SDK (Visual Studio 2010). <span class="anchor" id="line-23"></span><span class="anchor" id="line-24"></span></li></ul><p class="line867">
<h1 id="Lista_de_hist.2BAPM-rias">Lista de histórias</h1>
<span class="anchor" id="line-25"></span><p class="line874">A tabela abaixo apresenta as histórias implementadas nesta release.  <span class="anchor" id="line-26"></span><span class="anchor" id="line-27"></span><p class="line874">Apresentam-se as histórias ordenadas pela prioridade. <span class="anchor" id="line-28"></span><span class="anchor" id="line-29"></span><p class="line867">
<h2 id="Hist.2BAPM-rias">Histórias</h2>
<span class="anchor" id="line-30"></span><div><table><tbody><tr>  <td><p class="line891"><strong>ID</strong> </td>
  <td><p class="line891"><strong>História</strong> </td>
  <td><p class="line891"><strong>Estimativa</strong> </td>
  <td><p class="line891"><strong>Origem</strong> </td>
</tr>
<tr>  <td><span class="anchor" id="line-31"></span><p class="line891"><a href="/mywiki/Inviolatus/IC1">IC1</a> </td>
  <td><p class="line891"><strong>Certificado de Criptografia com SHA256 e SHA512</strong> </td>
  <td><p class="line862"> </td>
  <td><p class="line862"> CITEx|UNA </td>
</tr>
<tr>  <td><span class="anchor" id="line-32"></span><p class="line891"><a href="/mywiki/Faleweb/FS6">FS6</a></td>
  <td><p class="line891"><a href="/mywiki/Faleweb/FS6">Recompilar SDK</a></td>
  <td><p class="line862"> -  </td>
  <td><p class="line862"> - </td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></div><span class="anchor" id="line-33"></span><span class="anchor" id="line-34"></span><p class="line867">
